title: "GeoMultiCorr: surface displacement from optical images and time-series inversion"
abstract: "End-to-end Python pipeline for measuring earth-surface displacements from multi-sensor optical images and DEMs, from image correlation with the Ames Stereo Pipeline to time-series inversion."
